 "final_passage": "On Quillbench, Ridgeline-FT did not significantly differ from Plainweave-FT in pass@1 (46.1% ± 1.8% vs 45.6% ± 1.7%; paired t-test, Holm-adjusted p = 0.36, 95% CI [-0.75, 1.79] percentage points). However, Ridgeline-FT significantly outperformed Plainweave-FT in compile rate (93.1% ± 1.3% vs 90.4% ± 1.8%; paired t-test, Holm-adjusted p = 0.0087, 95% CI [1.19, 4.35] percentage points). Both fine-tuned recipes improved pass@1 and compile rate over the base Fernleaf-1.3B model (pass@1: 46.1% and 45.6% vs 31.4%; compile: 93.1% and 90.4% vs 84.0%).",
